Homepage: https://github.com/vishnu-bd-11832/log360devsuite
Description: Log360 Dev Suite remote management agent
 Cross-platform agent that connects managed machines to the Log360 Dev Suite
 portal. Provides heartbeat reporting, process monitoring, ManageEngine product
 detection, silent installer execution, log streaming, and backup management.
 .
 Configuration file: /etc/log360-agent/agent.json
 Log file:           /var/log/log360-agent.log
 Service name:       log360-agent (systemd)
